        <items xsi:type="form:FormGroup">
          <name>PageToCheck</name>
          <id>266</id>
          <items xsi:type="form:FormGroup">
            <name>WarningGroup</name>
            <id>614</id>
            <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
              <name>Warning</name>
              <id>616</id>
              <title>
                <key>en</key>
                <value>If discrepancies are found, it will be impossible to complete the check from standalone mode. In this case, connect to the Internet or select the &quot;Complete without check&quot; option. Otherwise, the changes will not be saved.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>fa</key>
                <value>در صورت یافتن مغایرت، تکمیل بررسی از حالت مستقل امکان‌پذیر نخواهد بود. در این صورت، به اینترنت متصل شوید یا گزینه &quot;تکمیل بدون بررسی&quot; را انتخاب کنید. در غیر این صورت، تغییرات ذخیره نخواهند شد.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>ru</key>
                <value>При обнаружении расхождений будет невозможно завершить проверку из автономного режима. В таком случае необходимо подключиться к интернету или выбрать опцию &quot;Завершить без проверки&quot;. Иначе выполненные изменения не сохранятся.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>tr</key>
                <value>Tutarsızlık tespit edildiğinde tek başına moddan kontrolü tamamlamak mümkün olmayacaktır. Bu durumda internete bağlanmak veya &quot;Kontrol etmeden tamamla&quot; seçeneğini seçmek gerekir. Aksi halde yapılan değişiklikler kaydedilmeyecektir.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>it</key>
                <value>If discrepancies are found, it will be impossible to complete the check from standalone mode. In this case, connect to the Internet or select the &quot;Complete without check&quot; option. Otherwise, the changes will not be saved.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>pl</key>
                <value>If discrepancies are found, it will be impossible to complete the check from standalone mode. In this case, connect to the Internet or select the &quot;Complete without check&quot; option. Otherwise, the changes will not be saved.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>vi</key>
                <value>If discrepancies are found, it will be impossible to complete the check from standalone mode. In this case, connect to the Internet or select the &quot;Complete without check&quot; option. Otherwise, the changes will not be saved.</value>
              </title>
              <visible>true</visible>
              <enabled>true</enabled>
              <userVisible>
                <common>true</common>
              </userVisible>
